  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"calculator\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"left\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"right\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. 3\">\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\">Calculate</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1e1e2f;\n  --card: #2a2a40;\n  --accent: #f0a500;\n  --text: #f5f5f5;\n  --border: #4a4a6a;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.calculator {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--border);\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\ninput, select, button {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  outline: none;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--border);\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ffc107;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 16px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  min-height: 80px;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .calculator {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n  }\n  #result {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  const left = document.getElementById('left');\n  const right = document.getElementById('right');\n  const operation = document.getElementById('operation');\n  const calculate = document.getElementById('calculate');\n  const result = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function compute() {\n    const a = parseFloat(left.value);\n    const b = parseFloat(right.value);\n\n    if (left.value.trim() === '' || right.value.trim() === '' || !isFinite(a) || !isFinite(b)) {\n      result.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    let value;\n    switch (operation.value) {\n      case 'add':\n        value = a + b;\n        break;\n      case 'subtract':\n        value = a - b;\n        break;\n      case 'multiply':\n        value = a * b;\n        break;\n      case 'divide':\n        if (b === 0) {\n          result.textContent = 'Error';\n          return;\n        }\n        value = a / b;\n        break;\n      default:\n        result.textContent = 'Error';\n        return;\n    }\n\n    if (!isFinite(value)) {\n      result.textContent = 'Error';\n    } else {\n      result.textContent = String(value);\n    }\n  }\n\n  calculate.addEventListener('click', compute);\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA simple offline pixel-style calculator that performs addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division on two numbers.\n\n## Features\n- Inputs for left and right numbers (supports negative values)\n- Operation selector: add, subtract, multiply, divide\n- Calculate button\n- Result output shows only the numeric result, or \"Error\" for invalid input or division by zero\n- Keyboard accessible with visible focus states\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide\n\n## Usage\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in the **Left number** field.\n3. Choose an operation from the dropdown.\n4. Enter a number in the **Right number** field.\n5. Click **Calculate** or press Enter while focused on a control.\n6. The result appears below the button.\n\n## Files\n- `index.html` – structure and required IDs\n- `styles.css` – pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` – calculation logic and validation\n\n## Constraints\n- No external dependencies, packages, or network requests\n- No storage or cookies\n- All logic runs client-side\n- Total lines across files under 200\n- Uses only HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
